Z||000004||Fierodave2001||06-01-2001||09:39 AM|||| <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by spideyfoot:<BR><B>So which one took home the best of show?</B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P>I did not hear about a "best of show" being picked.<P>After the awards were given out, most people<BR>were leaving. I left 'bout half hour after.<P>I saw one that I'd concider best of show, I<BR>would say his name, but he might drive his<BR>red GT w/customized front bumber w/driving<BR>lights added, over the curb.<P>Gosh, hope he doesn't figure out who I typing about.<P>(Of course, there was always this nice Blue GT .... , but that's another story)||||reg||1
